---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import company from '../../data/company.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | SMS"
  description={`How ${company.legalName} collects, uses, stores and discloses personal information in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the Australian Privacy Principles.`}
  canonicalPath="/disclaimer/"
>
  <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Disclaimer', href: '/disclaimer/' }]} />
  <Hero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" compact />

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <p class="text-sms-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed mb-2">
      {company.legalName} (ABN {company.abn}) (we, us, our) is committed to
      protecting the privacy of visitors to this website. This policy explains how we collect,
      use, store and disclose personal information in accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth)
      and the Australian Privacy Principles.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-sms-charcoal-400 mb-12">Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <section aria-labelledby="personal-info-heading" class="mb-10">
      <h2 id="personal-info-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-sms-charcoal-900 mb-4">Personal information</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sms-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed">
        <p>You may interact with us anonymously or under a pseudonym where this is lawful and practicable.</p>
        <p>
          We may collect personal information that you choose to provide to us, such as your
          name, email address or postal address, for example when you make an enquiry or request
          a quote.
        </p>
        <p>
          We may also collect non-personal information such as browser type, operating system and
          the pages you visit, to help us manage and improve our website. Where this information
          is combined with other data in a way that could identify you, we will treat it as
          personal information and handle it in line with this policy.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use cookies and similar technologies to operate and manage our website, including to
          understand how visitors use the site. We do not use these technologies to collect or
          store personal information unless you have opted in to a feature that requires it.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="uses-sharing-heading" class="mb-10">
      <h2 id="uses-sharing-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-sms-charcoal-900 mb-4">Uses and sharing</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sms-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We use personal information you provide only for the purpose you provided it, or for a
          directly related purpose you would reasonably expect.
        </p>
        <p>
          We will not use your personal information to market to you unless we have your implied
          or express consent, and you can opt out of marketing communications at any time.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not share your personal information with other organisations unless you give
          express consent, or the sharing is otherwise required or permitted by law.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where we provide personal information to organisations that perform services on our
          behalf, such as information technology providers, hosting providers, mail houses or
          other contractors, we require those organisations to protect your personal information
          to the same standard we do.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="overseas-heading" class="mb-10">
      <h2 id="overseas-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-sms-charcoal-900 mb-4">Overseas disclosure</h2>
      <p class="text-sms-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed">
        Some of the service providers we use, including website hosting, email and data storage
        providers, may store or process information on servers located outside Australia. Where
        this occurs, we take reasonable steps to ensure those providers handle personal
        information in a manner consistent with the Australian Privacy Principles.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="security-heading" class="mb-10">
      <h2 id="security-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-sms-charcoal-900 mb-4">Data security</h2>
      <p class="text-sms-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed">
        We take reasonable steps to protect the personal information we hold from misuse,
        interference, loss, and unauthorised access, modification or disclosure. This includes
        the use of technical and administrative safeguards appropriate to the sensitivity of the
        information collected.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="rights-heading" class="mb-10">
      <h2 id="rights-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-sms-charcoal-900 mb-4">Your rights and choices</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sms-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          You have the right to request access to the personal information we hold about you, and
          to ask us to correct or update it. This right is subject to certain exceptions permitted
          by law. If we refuse a request for access or correction, we will provide you with
          reasons for the refusal.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may withdraw any previous consent you gave to receive marketing communications from
          us at any time by contacting us using the details below.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <h2 id="contact-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-sms-charcoal-900 mb-4">How to contact our team</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4 text-sms-charcoal-500 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          We are committed to working with you to reach a fair resolution of any complaint or
          concern about privacy. To make a complaint or provide feedback, please contact our team
          using the details below. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sms-charcoal-700">
          {company.legalName}<br />
          {company.addressLine1}<br />
          {company.addressLine2}<br />
          ABN {company.abn}
        </p>
        <p>
          If you are not satisfied with our response, you may lodge a complaint with the Office of
          the Australian Information Commissioner (OAIC):
        </p>
        <p class="text-sms-charcoal-700">
          Website: <a href="https://www.oaic.gov.au" class="sms-link font-medium">www.oaic.gov.au</a><br />
          Phone: <a href="tel:1300363992" class="sms-link font-medium">1300 363 992</a><br />
          Post: GPO Box 5218, Sydney NSW 2001
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
